<title>SINGAPORE: YHS to launch Singapore property project.</title>
<headline>YHS to launch Singapore property project.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soft drinks company Yeo Hiap Seng Ltd (YHS) said on Wednesday it would launch its first residential property project in Singapore on Thursday.</p>
<p>Tivoli Gardens, in northeast Singapore, would be a 99-year leasehold development of 59 two-storey houses, a company statement said. Land areas would range from 1,615 sq ft (150 sq m) to 4,955 sq ft.</p>
<p>An industry source said the basic, pre-discount, asking price for each unit was likely to be from around Singapore $1.3 million.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703083)</p>
